{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>將軍澳發生持刀傷人案。昨晚（21日）11時許，一名年約30歲男子負傷自行前往將軍澳醫院，醫生發現其頭部和手部均有刀傷，於是通知警方。警方經調查後，初步相信事主在駿日街近一間航空發動機維修公司遇襲，正跟進案件。</p><p>就現場所見，上址環境僻靜，人煙極為稀少。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189826498538901504014853.jpeg/mwl_JSdcMWcCuR6cIJy7yGxKGo5kXAf2jXBLS7dwS0s\"/><figcaption>現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189826494969417728392178.jpeg/DX81pncKv5LnNMPbVk-Rr7M3zqF0tI654TecZNs3nGQ\"/><figcaption>現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:00:53.620338+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:35:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T22:57:42.246341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:57:42.246341+00:00","content_hash":"37f8cb627dc8fe4665bd82aa01c93d15b45cb375eb99290c209dbfd4926935bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}